<mxfile host="app" agent="nightshift"><diagram name="f1"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1590" pageHeight="880" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="n2" value="A CSV has no types" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=34;fontColor=#111111;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="44" width="1410" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n3" value="Every value arrives as text. This is where file pipelines actually break." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=21;fontColor=#6B7280;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="96" width="1410" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n4" value="trip_id,pu_zone_id,distance_km&lt;br&gt;TRP00281,9.0,4.2&lt;br&gt;TRP00282,,3.1&lt;br&gt;TRP00283,12,x" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=18;fontColor=#E2E8F0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="150" width="880" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n5" value="&lt;div style=&apos;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;color:#B91C1C&apos;&gt;int(&quot;9.0&quot;)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;font-size:19px;color:#111111;line-height:1.45&apos;&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;ValueError&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;The regulator holds zone ids&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;as floats, so it writes&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;9.0 and not 9.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#B91C1C;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1030" y="150" width="410" height="236" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n6" value="&lt;b&gt;float() first, then int().&lt;/b&gt; That looks fussy right up until the first time a pipeline dies at 2am on a value that looks perfectly fine.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;And wrap every conversion, because one malformed row in a file of 1,200 must not throw away the other 1,199." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=20;fontColor=#111111;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="470" width="1350" height="152" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="f2"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1120" pageHeight="880" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="n2" value="No file is not the same as an empty file" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=34;fontColor=#111111;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="44" width="940" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n3" value="They look identical in a row count, and mean completely different things." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=21;fontColor=#6B7280;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="96" width="940" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n4" value="&lt;div style=&apos;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;color:#B91C1C&apos;&gt;NO FILE&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;font-size:19px;color:#111111;line-height:1.45&apos;&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;The regulator&apos;s job failed.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;Somebody should call them.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#B91C1C;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="150" width="410" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n5" value="&lt;div style=&apos;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;color:#047857&apos;&gt;EMPTY FILE&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;font-size:19px;color:#111111;line-height:1.45&apos;&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;The regulator ran and had&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;nothing to send.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;Fine. Nothing to do.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#047857;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="150" width="410" height="208" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n6" value="&lt;b&gt;A pipeline that treats them the same&lt;/b&gt; will either page you every quiet weekend, or stay silent through a genuine outage.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;So count files as well as rows, and say both numbers out loud in the run message." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=20;fontColor=#111111;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="470" width="880" height="152" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="f3"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1120" pageHeight="940" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="n2" value="A fact and a dimension are rebuilt differently" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=34;fontColor=#111111;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="44" width="940" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n3" value="Same warehouse, same tools, two completely different write strategies." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=21;fontColor=#6B7280;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="96" width="940" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n4" value="&lt;div style=&apos;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;color:#1D4ED8&apos;&gt;A FACT   ·   bronze_trips&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;font-family:Courier New;font-size:17px;margin-top:7px&apos;&gt;something that happened&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;font-family:Courier New;font-size:17px;margin-top:7px&apos;&gt;has a date&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;font-family:Courier New;font-size:17px;margin-top:7px&apos;&gt;rebuilt one WINDOW at a time&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;font-family:Courier New;font-size:17px;margin-top:7px&apos;&gt;delete the window, insert it back&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;font-size:16px;color:#6B7280;margin-top:12px&apos;&gt;millions of rows, so you never touch all of them&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EFF4FF;strokeColor=#1D4ED8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="150" width="410" height="248" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n5" value="&lt;div style=&apos;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;color:#047857&apos;&gt;A DIMENSION   ·   bronze_zones&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;font-family:Courier New;font-size:17px;margin-top:7px&apos;&gt;something that IS&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;font-family:Courier New;font-size:17px;margin-top:7px&apos;&gt;has no date&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;font-family:Courier New;font-size:17px;margin-top:7px&apos;&gt;replaced ENTIRELY, every run&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;font-family:Courier New;font-size:17px;margin-top:7px&apos;&gt;delete everything, insert everything&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;font-size:16px;color:#6B7280;margin-top:12px&apos;&gt;sixty one rows, so replacing all of them is free&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#047857;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="150" width="410" height="248" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n6" value="&lt;b&gt;What a full snapshot loses is history.&lt;/b&gt; Rename a zone and the old name is gone, with nothing recording that it ever existed. That is usually fine for reference data. When it is not, the technique is called a &lt;b&gt;slowly changing dimension&lt;/b&gt;: worth having heard the phrase, not worth building today." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=20;fontColor=#111111;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="500" width="880" height="182" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>